    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108410" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόθερμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>somewhat hot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.240
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.108
			</span></i>: of persons, <i>somewhat hot</i> or <i>passionate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθερμότερος τῷ ἔργῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cal.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. βλέμμα,</span> of a horse,
				<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.192
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνου ὑ. δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1146f
				</span></i>
			.</div>
